Object.assign(window.__CMPDATA__=window.__CMPDATA__||{},{"alloydb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。托管版数据默认由 Google 管理的密钥加密落盘；支持 CMEK——密钥存于 Cloud KMS（软件密钥或 Cloud HSM 硬件密钥），另支持 Cloud EKM 外部密钥管理与 KMS Autokey；加密覆盖数据库与备份。Omni 侧：Kubernetes operator 1.8.0（2026-07-15）T…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。托管版数据默认由 Google 管理的密钥加密落盘；支持 CMEK——密钥存于 Cloud KMS（软件密钥或 Cloud HSM 硬件密钥），另支持 Cloud EKM 外部密钥管理与 KMS Autokey；加密覆盖数据库与备份。Omni 侧：Kubernetes operator 1.8.0（2026-07-15）TDE GA，加密数据文件、备份与缓存溢出到磁盘的数据；容器版 18.1.0 TDE 为 Preview。注意托管版官方口径不称&quot;TDE&quot;，但落盘加密+CMEK 的实质等价。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Managed edition data is encrypted at rest by default with Google-managed keys; CMEK supported — keys stored in Cloud KMS (software keys or Cloud HSM …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Managed edition data is encrypted at rest by default with Google-managed keys; CMEK supported — keys stored in Cloud KMS (software keys or Cloud HSM hardware keys), plus Cloud EKM external key management and KMS Autokey; encryption covers databases and backups. Omni side: Kubernetes operator 1.8.0 (2026-07-15) TDE is GA, encrypting data files, backups, and data spilled to disk from caches; container edition 18.1.0 TDE is Preview. Note the managed edition&#x27;s official documentation does not use the term &quot;TDE&quot;, but encryption at rest + CMEK is the substantive equivalent.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。AlloyDB Auth Proxy 可把非 TLS 连接透明升级为 TLS 1.3；语言连接器（Language Connectors）使用 mTLS；支持 VPC 私有连接。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。AlloyDB Auth Proxy 可把非 TLS 连接透明升级为 TLS 1.3；语言连接器（Language Connectors）使用 mTLS；支持 VPC 私有连接。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. AlloyDB Auth Proxy can transparently upgrade non-TLS connections to TLS 1.3; Language Connectors use mTLS; VPC private connectivity supported.</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. AlloyDB Auth Proxy can transparently upgrade non-TLS connections to TLS 1.3; Language Connectors use mTLS; VPC private connectivity supported.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向为主 + 读横向扩展</span><p class=\"snippet\">纵向为主 + 读横向扩展。主实例纵向扩缩（官方称近乎无中断）；读扩展靠 read pool（全集群最多 20 个读节点，共享同一份存储，读副本不产生额外存储费用）；写扩展上限为主实例规格——不是 Spanner 式的无上限水平写扩展。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向为主 + 读横向扩展</span><p>纵向为主 + 读横向扩展。主实例纵向扩缩（官方称近乎无中断）；读扩展靠 read pool（全集群最多 20 个读节点，共享同一份存储，读副本不产生额外存储费用）；写扩展上限为主实例规格——不是 Spanner 式的无上限水平写扩展。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Primarily vertical</span><p class=\"snippet\">Primarily vertical + read scale-out. Primary instance vertical scaling (officially described as near-zero-downtime); read scaling via read pools (up to 20 read nodes per …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Primarily vertical</span><p>Primarily vertical + read scale-out. Primary instance vertical scaling (officially described as near-zero-downtime); read scaling via read pools (up to 20 read nodes per cluster, sharing the same storage; read replicas incur no additional storage charges); write scaling ceiling is the primary instance size — not the unbounded horizontal write scaling of Spanner. Source level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">PostgreSQL 线协议/S</span><p class=\"snippet\">PostgreSQL 线协议/SQL 全兼容（官方口径&quot;100% PG compatible&quot;）；50+ 扩展（含 PostGIS、pgvector、自研 alloydb_scann、google_ml_integration、google_columnar_engine）；标准 PG 驱动/psql 即插即用。来源等级：官方口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">PostgreSQL 线协议/S</span><p>PostgreSQL 线协议/SQL 全兼容（官方口径&quot;100% PG compatible&quot;）；50+ 扩展（含 PostGIS、pgvector、自研 alloydb_scann、google_ml_integration、google_columnar_engine）；标准 PG 驱动/psql 即插即用。来源等级：官方口径</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">PostgreSQL wire pr</span><p class=\"snippet\">PostgreSQL wire protocol/SQL fully compatible (official statement: &quot;100% PG compatible&quot;); 50+ extensions (including PostGIS, pgvector, in-house alloydb_scann, google_ml_i…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">PostgreSQL wire pr</span><p>PostgreSQL wire protocol/SQL fully compatible (official statement: &quot;100% PG compatible&quot;); 50+ extensions (including PostGIS, pgvector, in-house alloydb_scann, google_ml_integration, google_columnar_engine); standard PG drivers/psql work out of the box. Source level: official statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无 I/O 费用</span><p class=\"snippet\">商业云服务 + Omni 商业软件订阅。按 vCPU + 内存 + 实际使用存储计费，无 I/O 费用（官方定价策略，厂商口径）；读副本不收存储费；1/3 年 committed use discount；Omni 生产按 vCPU 订阅、非生产免费。只描述模型，不引用具体标价。来源等级：官方口径</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无 I/O 费用</span><p>商业云服务 + Omni 商业软件订阅。按 vCPU + 内存 + 实际使用存储计费，<strong>无 I/O 费用</strong>（官方定价策略，厂商口径）；读副本不收存储费；1/3 年 committed use discount；Omni 生产按 vCPU 订阅、非生产免费。只描述模型，不引用具体标价。来源等级：官方口径</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">no I/O charges</span><p class=\"snippet\">Commercial cloud service + Omni commercial software subscription. Billed on vCPU + memory + actual storage used, no I/O charges (official pricing policy, vendor claim); r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">no I/O charges</span><p>Commercial cloud service + Omni commercial software subscription. Billed on vCPU + memory + actual storage used, <strong>no I/O charges</strong> (official pricing policy, vendor claim); read replicas incur no storage charges; 1/3-year committed use discounts; Omni production billed per vCPU subscription, non-production free. Model described only, no absolute prices cited. Source level: official statement</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">中等</span><p class=\"snippet\">中等。官方文档提供中文版；中文社区实战文章少于 Cloud SQL<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">中等</span><p><strong>中等</strong>。官方文档提供中文版；中文社区实战文章少于 Cloud SQL<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。来源等级：官方文档 + 社区共识</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Moderate</span><p class=\"snippet\">Moderate. Official documentation available in Chinese; fewer Chinese community hands-on articles than Cloud SQL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Source level: official docs + commu…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Moderate</span><p><strong>Moderate</strong>. Official documentation available in Chinese; fewer Chinese community hands-on articles than Cloud SQL <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Source level: official docs + community consensus</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。两层：① pgAudit 扩展做 SQL 级会话/对象审计，需开 alloydb.enable_pgaudit flag（实例重启生效），日志摄入速率上限 4MB/s，超限可能导致磁盘打满甚至丢审计日志；② Cloud Audit Logs 记录管理面操作（Admin Activity / Data Access / Sy…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。两层：① pgAudit 扩展做 SQL 级会话/对象审计，需开 <code>alloydb.enable_pgaudit</code> flag（实例重启生效），日志摄入速率上限 4MB/s，超限可能导致磁盘打满甚至丢审计日志；② Cloud Audit Logs 记录管理面操作（Admin Activity / Data Access / System Event）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Two layers: ① the pgAudit extension for SQL-level session/object auditing, requires the alloydb.enable_pgaudit flag (takes effect after instance rest…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Two layers: ① the pgAudit extension for SQL-level session/object auditing, requires the <code>alloydb.enable_pgaudit</code> flag (takes effect after instance restart), with a log ingestion rate cap of 4MB/s — exceeding it can fill the disk or even lose audit logs; ② Cloud Audit Logs record control-plane operations (Admin Activity / Data Access / System Event).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。支持 IAM 数据库认证（短时令牌，替代静态密码）与传统 PG 密码用户（BUILT_IN）并存；另支持无密码认证选项；Omni 容器版 17.5.0 起支持 AD 组授权（GA）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。支持 IAM 数据库认证（短时令牌，替代静态密码）与传统 PG 密码用户（BUILT_IN）并存；另支持无密码认证选项；Omni 容器版 17.5.0 起支持 AD 组授权（GA）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Supports IAM database authentication (short-lived tokens replacing static passwords) coexisting with traditional PostgreSQL password users (BUILT_IN)…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Supports IAM database authentication (short-lived tokens replacing static passwords) coexisting with traditional PostgreSQL password users (BUILT_IN); passwordless authentication option also supported; Omni container edition supports AD group authorization (GA) from 17.5.0.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续备份+PITR 默认开启，保留窗口 1–35 天可配，每日增量备份，微秒级时间点恢复<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；支持按需全量备份、计划自动备份、升级前后自动生成的系统备份。关键限制：恢复永远生成一个新集群，不支持原地回滚<span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续备份+PITR 默认开启，保留窗口 1–35 天可配，每日增量备份，微秒级时间点恢复<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；支持按需全量备份、计划自动备份、升级前后自动生成的系统备份。关键限制：<strong>恢复永远生成一个新集群，不支持原地回滚</strong><span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous backup + PITR enabled by default, configurable retention window of 1–35 days, daily incremental backups, microsecond-level point-in-time r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous backup + PITR enabled by default, configurable retention window of 1–35 days, daily incremental backups, microsecond-level point-in-time recovery; on-demand full backups, scheduled automatic backups, and system backups auto-generated before/after upgrades supported. Key limitation: <strong>recovery always creates a new cluster; in-place rollback is not supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-tested\" data-zh=\"社区实测\" data-en=\"community-tested\">社区实测</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。支持原地大版本升级：总耗时 40 分钟–48 小时（随库大小增长，128TB 约 22 小时），主库停机典型 20 分钟–1 小时；升级前有预检，失败可在读池升级阶段前回滚（系统备份作为回滚点）。PG 18 Preview 暂不支持原地升级。Omni 自行负责，用标准 pg_upgrade 流程。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。支持原地大版本升级：总耗时 40 分钟–48 小时（随库大小增长，128TB 约 22 小时），主库停机典型 20 分钟–1 小时；升级前有预检，失败可在读池升级阶段前回滚（系统备份作为回滚点）。PG 18 Preview 暂不支持原地升级。Omni 自行负责，用标准 pg_upgrade 流程。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Supports in-place major version upgrades: total duration 40 minutes–48 hours (grows with database size; ~22 hours for 128TB), typical…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Supports in-place major version upgrades: total duration 40 minutes–48 hours (grows with database size; ~22 hours for 128TB), typical primary downtime 20 minutes–1 hour; pre-upgrade checks available, rollback possible before the read-pool upgrade phase (system backups serve as rollback points). PG 18 Preview does not support in-place upgrades. Omni is self-managed with the standard pg_upgrade process.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cloud Monitoring 指标（CPU/存储/网络/内存/连接数）、Query Insights、pg_stat_statements、auto_explain flag；Omni 支持日志轮转（默认 200MB 轮转、归档保留 7 天）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cloud Monitoring 指标（CPU/存储/网络/内存/连接数）、Query Insights、pg_stat_statements、auto_explain flag；Omni 支持日志轮转（默认 200MB 轮转、归档保留 7 天）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cloud Monitoring metrics (CPU/storage/network/memory/connections), Query Insights, pg_stat_statements, auto_explain flag; Omni supports log rotation …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cloud Monitoring metrics (CPU/storage/network/memory/connections), Query Insights, pg_stat_statements, auto_explain flag; Omni supports log rotation (default 200MB rotation, 7-day archive retention).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。默认 max_connections=1000，可调至 240,000；官方建议每 vCPU 不超过 4 个并发查询；托管版提供内置托管连接池（默认 transaction 模式，默认池 50/库-用户对，最大客户端连接默认 5000）；短连接场景官方仍建议应用侧连接池（HikariCP/c3p0）或 PgBouncer；…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。默认 max_connections=1000，可调至 240,000；官方建议每 vCPU 不超过 4 个并发查询；托管版提供内置托管连接池（默认 transaction 模式，默认池 50/库-用户对，最大客户端连接默认 5000）；短连接场景官方仍建议应用侧连接池（HikariCP/c3p0）或 PgBouncer；Omni Kubernetes 版提供 PgBouncer CRD。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Default max_connections=1000, adjustable up to 240,000; official recommendation of no more than 4 concurrent queries per vCPU; the managed edition pr…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Default max_connections=1000, adjustable up to 240,000; official recommendation of no more than 4 concurrent queries per vCPU; the managed edition provides a built-in managed connection pool (default transaction mode, default pool 50 per database-user pair, default max client connections 5000); for short-lived connection workloads the official guidance still recommends application-side pooling (HikariCP/c3p0) or PgBouncer; the Omni Kubernetes edition provides a PgBouncer CRD.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。与社区 PG 相同的 MVCC 事务模型<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>。与社区 PG 相同的 MVCC 事务模型<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes. Same MVCC transaction model as community PostgreSQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Source level: official docs</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong>. Same MVCC transaction model as community PostgreSQL <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Source level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "alloydb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有。区域内基于日志的分布式存储层同步复制；跨区为异步 secondary cluster 复制。来源等级：官方文档</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>。区域内基于日志的分布式存储层同步复制；跨区为异步 secondary cluster 复制。来源等级：官方文档</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p class=\"snippet\">Yes. Log-based distributed storage-layer synchronous replication within a region; asynchronous secondary cluster replication across regions. Source level: official docs</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Yes</span><p><strong>Yes</strong>. Log-based distributed storage-layer synchronous replication within a region; asynchronous secondary cluster replication across regions. Source level: official docs</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。集群级 KMS AES-256，覆盖存储卷、自动备份、快照、副本；创建时开启，创建后不可修改（immutable，要加密旧库只能快照→加密复制→恢复→切换）。注意两点反直觉：MySQL 的 InnoDB 表空间级 TDE（ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;）不支持（查证为无），keyring 插件全系不支持——加密是卷级的，不是…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。集群级 KMS AES-256，覆盖存储卷、自动备份、快照、副本；<strong>创建时开启，创建后不可修改</strong>（immutable，要加密旧库只能快照→加密复制→恢复→切换）。注意两点反直觉：MySQL 的 InnoDB 表空间级 TDE（<code>ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;</code>）<strong>不支持</strong>（查证为无），keyring 插件全系不支持——加密是卷级的，不是表级的。新集群默认开启加密为社区说法，<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cluster-level KMS AES-256, covering storage volumes, automated backups, snapshots, replicas; enabled at creation time and immutable afterward (…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cluster-level KMS AES-256, covering storage volumes, automated backups, snapshots, replicas; <strong>enabled at creation time and immutable afterward</strong> (to encrypt an existing cluster you must snapshot → copy with encryption → restore → cut over). Two counter-intuitive notes: MySQL InnoDB tablespace-level TDE (<code>ENCRYPTION=&#x27;Y&#x27;</code>) is <strong>unsupported</strong> (verified absent), and keyring plugins are unsupported across the board — encryption is at the volume level, not the table level. &quot;New clusters have encryption on by default&quot; is a community claim, <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS/SSL；Aurora MySQL 8.4 新集群默认强制 TLS（仅 1.2/1.3）；MySQL 侧 require_secure_transport、PG 侧 rds.force_ssl。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。TLS/SSL；Aurora MySQL 8.4 新集群默认强制 TLS（仅 1.2/1.3）；MySQL 侧 <code>require_secure_transport</code>、PG 侧 <code>rds.force_ssl</code>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS/SSL; Aurora MySQL 8.4 new clusters enforce TLS by default (1.2/1.3 only); require_secure_transport on the MySQL side, rds.force_ssl on the …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. TLS/SSL; Aurora MySQL 8.4 new clusters enforce TLS by default (1.2/1.3 only); <code>require_secure_transport</code> on the MySQL side, <code>rds.force_ssl</code> on the PG side.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向</span><p class=\"snippet\">纵向（实例规格；Serverless v2 0~256 ACU 自动）+ 横向读扩展（最多 15 副本）+ 存储自动扩容（10GB→256 TiB，只增不减）。写扩展靠 Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless（分片架构，router/shard 两层）。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">纵向</span><p>纵向（实例规格；Serverless v2 0~256 ACU 自动）+ 横向读扩展（最多 15 副本）+ 存储自动扩容（10GB→256 TiB，<strong>只增不减</strong>）。写扩展靠 Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless（分片架构，router/shard 两层）。<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Vertical</span><p class=\"snippet\">Vertical (instance classes; Serverless v2 0–256 ACU automatic) + horizontal read scale-out (up to 15 replicas) + automatic storage expansion (10GB → 256 TiB, grow-only). …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Vertical</span><p>Vertical (instance classes; Serverless v2 0–256 ACU automatic) + horizontal read scale-out (up to 15 replicas) + automatic storage expansion (10GB → 256 TiB, <strong>grow-only</strong>). Write scale-out via Aurora PostgreSQL Limitless (sharded architecture, router/shard two-tier). <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档 + 社区共识）。MySQL 协议（3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45；8.4 ~ 社区 8.4.7 LTS 且版本号对齐）、PG 协议（18.4 等）。JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium 等生态工具通用。PG 扩展为白名单制（SHOW rds.extensions），冷门扩展无自助安装通道。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档 + 社区共识）。MySQL 协议（3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45；8.4 ~ 社区 8.4.7 LTS 且版本号对齐）、PG 协议（18.4 等）。JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium 等生态工具通用。PG 扩展为白名单制（<code>SHOW rds.extensions</code>），冷门扩展无自助安装通道。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">MySQL protocol</span><p class=\"snippet\">MySQL protocol (3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45; 8.4 ~ community 8.4.7 LTS with aligned version numbers), PG protocol (18.4, etc.). JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium ecosystem tools all wor…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">MySQL protocol</span><p>MySQL protocol (3.x ~ MySQL 8.0.45; 8.4 ~ community 8.4.7 LTS with aligned version numbers), PG protocol (18.4, etc.). JDBC / ORM / DMS / Debezium ecosystem tools all work. PG extensions are whitelist-based (<code>SHOW rds.extensions</code>); obscure extensions have no self-service installation channel.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有（官方文档，闭源商业 + 厂商口径计费模型）。闭源商业，按量付费：计算（实例小时 / ACU-秒）+ 存储（GB-月）+ I/O（Standard 版按百万次）+ 备份/传输；Database Savings Plans / RI 可打折；无开源版。AWS 锁定是最大的商业现实：无他云、无自建，迁出=逻辑迁移。只写计费模型，不写绝对标价…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong>（官方文档，闭源商业 + 厂商口径计费模型）。闭源商业，按量付费：计算（实例小时 / ACU-秒）+ 存储（GB-月）+ I/O（Standard 版按百万次）+ 备份/传输；Database Savings Plans / RI 可打折；无开源版。<strong>AWS 锁定是最大的商业现实</strong>：无他云、无自建，迁出=逻辑迁移。只写计费模型，不写绝对标价。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p class=\"snippet\">Closed-source commercial, pay-as-you-go: compute (instance-hours / ACU-seconds) + storage (GB-month) + I/O (Standard edition billed per million I/Os) + backup/transfer; D…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Closed-source comm</span><p>Closed-source commercial, pay-as-you-go: compute (instance-hours / ACU-seconds) + storage (GB-month) + I/O (Standard edition billed per million I/Os) + backup/transfer; Database Savings Plans / RIs can discount; no open-source edition. <strong>AWS lock-in is the biggest commercial reality</strong>: no other cloud, no self-hosted edition, leaving = logical migration.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p class=\"snippet\">中等<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/博客）不少，但深度调优、故障排查内容多为英文（re:Post、AWS Blog）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后</span><p><strong>中等</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。官方文档有中文版但部分页面翻译滞后；中文社区实践帖（CSDN/博客）不少，但深度调优、故障排查内容多为英文（re:Post、AWS Blog）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Moderate</span><p class=\"snippet\">Moderate <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/blogs) are plentiful, but d…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Moderate</span><p><strong>Moderate</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. Official docs have a Chinese edition but some pages lag in translation; Chinese community practice posts (CSDN/blogs) are plentiful, but deep tuning and troubleshooting content is mostly in English (re:Post, AWS Blog).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Database Activity Streams（近实时活动流，KMS 加密，sync/async 两种模式，async 高负载可能丢日志）；Aurora MySQL 支持 MariaDB Audit Plugin（高级审计）；PG 支持 pgaudit 扩展；日志可导出 CloudWatch。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Database Activity Streams（近实时活动流，KMS 加密，sync/async 两种模式，async 高负载可能丢日志）；Aurora MySQL 支持 MariaDB Audit Plugin（高级审计）；PG 支持 pgaudit 扩展；日志可导出 CloudWatch。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Database Activity Streams (near-real-time activity stream, KMS-encrypted, sync/async modes; async mode can drop logs under heavy load); Aurora …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Database Activity Streams (near-real-time activity stream, KMS-encrypted, sync/async modes; async mode can drop logs under heavy load); Aurora MySQL supports the MariaDB Audit Plugin (advanced auditing); PG supports the pgaudit extension; logs can be exported to CloudWatch.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。密码、IAM 数据库认证（token 15 分钟有效期）、Secrets Manager 集成、PG 支持 Kerberos/AD。上限是 rds_superuser，无 SUPER 权限：不能改 pg_hba.conf、不能 ALTER SYSTEM、不能建 C 语言函数、不能装非白名单扩展。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。密码、IAM 数据库认证（token 15 分钟有效期）、Secrets Manager 集成、PG 支持 Kerberos/AD。上限是 <code>rds_superuser</code>，<strong>无 SUPER 权限</strong>：不能改 <code>pg_hba.conf</code>、不能 <code>ALTER SYSTEM</code>、不能建 C 语言函数、不能装非白名单扩展。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Passwords, IAM database authentication (tokens valid for 15 minutes), Secrets Manager integration, PG supports Kerberos/AD. The ceiling is rds_…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Passwords, IAM database authentication (tokens valid for 15 minutes), Secrets Manager integration, PG supports Kerberos/AD. The ceiling is <code>rds_superuser</code> — <strong>no SUPER privilege</strong>: you cannot edit <code>pg_hba.conf</code>, cannot <code>ALTER SYSTEM</code>, cannot create C-language functions, cannot install non-whitelisted extensions.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续增量备份到 S3（对性能无影响）+ PITR 任意秒级恢复（保留期 1~35 天，恢复=建新集群）；手动快照；跨 Region 快照复制；克隆（copy-on-write）；Backtrack 仅 Aurora MySQL（建集群时启用，72 小时窗口）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。连续增量备份到 S3（对性能无影响）+ PITR 任意秒级恢复（保留期 1~35 天，恢复=建新集群）；手动快照；跨 Region 快照复制；克隆（copy-on-write）；Backtrack 仅 Aurora MySQL（建集群时启用，72 小时窗口）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous incremental backup to S3 (zero performance impact) + PITR recovery to any second (retention 1–35 days, recovery = create a new clust…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Continuous incremental backup to S3 (zero performance impact) + PITR recovery to any second (retention 1–35 days, recovery = create a new cluster); manual snapshots; cross-Region snapshot copy; clone (copy-on-write); Backtrack only on Aurora MySQL (enabled at cluster creation, 72-hour window).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持（官方文档 + 社区实测）。三条路：原地升级（要停机窗口）、蓝绿部署（厂商口径切换 &lt;1 分钟，2026-04 起支持 RDS Proxy 联动消 DNS 延迟）、快照恢复式升级。不可原地降级，in-place 升级无官方回滚（只能靠升级前快照恢复=丢数据，或蓝绿回切）；参数组族必须与目标版本匹配，否则升级失败或静默丢自定义参数；…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>（官方文档 + 社区实测）。三条路：原地升级（要停机窗口）、蓝绿部署（厂商口径切换 &lt;1 分钟，2026-04 起支持 RDS Proxy 联动消 DNS 延迟）、快照恢复式升级。<strong>不可原地降级</strong>，in-place 升级无官方回滚（只能靠升级前快照恢复=丢数据，或蓝绿回切）；参数组族必须与目标版本匹配，否则升级失败或静默丢自定义参数；Aurora MySQL 8.4 新增自动升级 precheck。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official docs + community-tested). Three paths: in-place upgrade (requires a maintenance window), blue/green deployment (vendor claim: switchover &lt;1 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs + community-tested). Three paths: in-place upgrade (requires a maintenance window), blue/green deployment (vendor claim: switchover &lt;1 minute; RDS Proxy integration to eliminate DNS lag since 2026-04), snapshot-restore upgrade. <strong>No in-place downgrade</strong>; in-place upgrades have no official rollback (only restoring from a pre-upgrade snapshot, which means data loss, or blue/green cutback); the parameter group family must match the target version or the upgrade fails or silently drops custom parameters; Aurora MySQL 8.4 added an automated upgrade precheck.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch（Database Insights）、Performance Insights（7 天保留免费，超期按 vCPU 收费）、Enhanced Monitoring（走 CloudWatch Logs 计费）、慢查询日志（要手动在参数组开启并导出，产生日志费用）、DevOps Guru for RDS。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。CloudWatch（Database Insights）、Performance Insights（7 天保留免费，超期按 vCPU 收费）、Enhanced Monitoring（走 CloudWatch Logs 计费）、慢查询日志（要手动在参数组开启并导出，产生日志费用）、DevOps Guru for RDS。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch (Database Insights), Performance Insights (7-day retention free, beyond that billed per vCPU), Enhanced Monitoring (billed via Cloud…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. CloudWatch (Database Insights), Performance Insights (7-day retention free, beyond that billed per vCPU), Enhanced Monitoring (billed via CloudWatch Logs), slow query logs (must be manually enabled in the parameter group and exported, incurring log charges), DevOps Guru for RDS.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">每连接一个后端进程</span><p class=\"snippet\">每连接一个后端进程（MySQL 线程 / PG 进程），连接风暴靠 RDS Proxy 解<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>：托管连接池、IAM 认证、Secrets Manager、failover 感知（不靠 DNS）。reader endpoint 是 DNS 轮询（TTL 5 秒），不是真负载均衡——长连接池不回收会钉死在个别 reader 上。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">每连接一个后端进程</span><p>每连接一个后端进程（MySQL 线程 / PG 进程），连接风暴靠 <strong>RDS Proxy</strong> 解<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>：托管连接池、IAM 认证、Secrets Manager、failover 感知（不靠 DNS）。reader endpoint 是 DNS 轮询（TTL 5 秒），<strong>不是真负载均衡</strong>——长连接池不回收会钉死在个别 reader 上。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">One backend proces</span><p class=\"snippet\">One backend process per connection (MySQL thread / PG process); connection storms are handled by RDS Proxy <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>: managed connection pooling, IAM authentication…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">One backend proces</span><p>One backend process per connection (MySQL thread / PG process); connection storms are handled by <strong>RDS Proxy</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>: managed connection pooling, IAM authentication, Secrets Manager, failover-aware (not DNS-based). The reader endpoint is DNS round-robin (TTL 5 seconds), <strong>not true load balancing</strong> — connection pools that never recycle connections will pin to individual readers.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">继承引擎<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p class=\"snippet\">继承引擎<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。MySQL：InnoDB，默认 REPEATABLE READ；PG：默认 READ COMMITTED，支持 SERIALIZABLE。写转发下 MySQL 仅支持 REPEATABLE READ；Limitless 跨分片事务有限制；XA 支持（PG 需 max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">继承引擎<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span></span><p><strong>继承引擎</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。MySQL：InnoDB，默认 REPEATABLE READ；PG：默认 READ COMMITTED，支持 SERIALIZABLE。写转发下 MySQL 仅支持 REPEATABLE READ；Limitless 跨分片事务有限制；XA 支持（PG 需 <code>max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0</code>）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Inherited from the</span><p class=\"snippet\">Inherited from the engine <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL: InnoDB, default REPEATABLE READ; PG: default READ COMMITTED, SERIALIZABLE supported. Under write forwarding, MySQL suppo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Inherited from the</span><p><strong>Inherited from the engine</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. MySQL: InnoDB, default REPEATABLE READ; PG: default READ COMMITTED, SERIALIZABLE supported. Under write forwarding, MySQL supports only REPEATABLE READ; Limitless cross-shard transactions have restrictions; XA supported (PG requires <code>max_prepared_transactions &gt; 0</code>).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "aurora__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，架构核心</span><p class=\"snippet\">有，架构核心（官方论文 + 官方文档）。存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，写 quorum 4/6、读 quorum 3/6；计算层只向存储层发 redo 日志（&quot;log is the database&quot;）；reader 共享同一存储卷，复制延迟为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；Global Database 跨 Region 存储层异步物理复制（厂商口…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有，架构核心</span><p><strong>有，架构核心</strong>（官方论文 + 官方文档）。存储层 6 副本跨 3 AZ，写 quorum 4/6、读 quorum 3/6；计算层只向存储层发 redo 日志（&quot;log is the database&quot;）；reader 共享同一存储卷，复制延迟为毫秒级<span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>；Global Database 跨 Region 存储层异步物理复制（厂商口径典型 &lt;1 秒）；MySQL 另有 binlog / Enhanced Binlog 逻辑复制选项。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported, architectural core (official paper + official docs). Storage layer: 6 copies across 3 AZs, write quorum 4/6, read quorum 3/6; the compute layer only sends redo…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported, architectural core</strong> (official paper + official docs). Storage layer: 6 copies across 3 AZs, write quorum 4/6, read quorum 3/6; the compute layer only sends redo logs to the storage layer (&quot;log is the database&quot;); readers share the same storage volume, replication lag in milliseconds <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>; Global Database: cross-Region asynchronous physical replication at the storage layer (vendor claim: typically &lt;1 second); MySQL additionally offers binlog / Enhanced Binlog logical replication options.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。commitlog 可加密（transparent_data_encryption_options）；SSTable 落盘加密在开源版查证为无（该能力历史上保留给 DataStax Enterprise）；备份（nodetool snapshot）无内置加密，依赖对象存储服务端加密<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。 S…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。commitlog 可加密（<code>transparent_data_encryption_options</code>）；<strong>SSTable 落盘加密在开源版查证为无</strong>（该能力历史上保留给 DataStax Enterprise）；备份（nodetool snapshot）无内置加密，依赖对象存储服务端加密<span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong>（官方文档/官方博客）。统一版本包含原企业版的落盘加密；Cloud 版支持数据库级加密（AES-128/256，用户表 + commitlog + batchlog + hint 均加密，支持 AWS/GCP KMS 客户主密钥）；自建版 KMS 集成细节待验证。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Partially supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The commitlog can be encrypted (transparent_data_encryption_options); SSTable data-at-rest encryption is confirmed absent …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Partially supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. The commitlog can be encrypted (<code>transparent_data_encryption_options</code>); <strong>SSTable data-at-rest encryption is confirmed absent in the open-source edition</strong> (that capability was historically reserved for DataStax Enterprise); backups (nodetool snapshot) have no built-in encryption and rely on object-store server-side encryption <span class=\"ev ev-tbd\" data-zh=\"待验证\" data-en=\"to-be-verified\">待验证</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / official blog). The unified release includes what was formerly the enterprise edition&#x27;s data-at-rest encryption; the Cloud edition supports database-level encryption (AES-128/256, encrypting user tables + commitlog + batchlog + hints, with AWS/GCP KMS customer master keys); self-hosted KMS integration details to-be-verified.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__1": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：client_encryption_options（客户端↔节点）与 server_encryption_options（节点间，internode_encryption: all/dc/none）；5.0 新增 mTLS 证书认证（官方发布口径）。ScyllaDB：同等 client/server 加…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：<code>client_encryption_options</code>（客户端↔节点）与 <code>server_encryption_options</code>（节点间，<code>internode_encryption: all/dc/none</code>）；5.0 新增 <strong>mTLS 证书认证</strong>（官方发布口径）。ScyllaDB：同等 client/server 加密选项，支持证书认证（<code>CertificateAuthenticator</code>，社区实测）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: client_encryption_options (client↔node) and server_encryption_options (internode, internode_encryption: all/dc/none); 5.0 adds mTLS …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: <code>client_encryption_options</code> (client↔node) and <code>server_encryption_options</code> (internode, <code>internode_encryption: all/dc/none</code>); 5.0 adds <strong>mTLS certificate authentication</strong> (official release claim). ScyllaDB: equivalent client/server encryption options with certificate authentication support (<code>CertificateAuthenticator</code>, community-tested).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__10": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">横向 scale-out，在线</span><p class=\"snippet\">横向 scale-out，在线<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。加节点自动分担 token/tablet 范围；Cassandra 4.0 起符合条件的 SSTable 走零拷贝 streaming（官方口径，扩容快 5 倍为厂商口径）；ScyllaDB tablets + 文件级 streaming 使加节点更快（30 倍为厂商口径，见深水区）。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">横向 scale-out，在线</span><p><strong>横向 scale-out，在线</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。加节点自动分担 token/tablet 范围；Cassandra 4.0 起符合条件的 SSTable 走零拷贝 streaming（官方口径，扩容快 5 倍为厂商口径）；ScyllaDB tablets + 文件级 streaming 使加节点更快（30 倍为厂商口径，见深水区）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Horizontal scale-o</span><p class=\"snippet\">Horizontal scale-out, online <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding nodes automatically re-shares token/tablet ranges; since Cassandra 4.0, eligible SSTables use zero-copy streaming (ve…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Horizontal scale-o</span><p><strong>Horizontal scale-out, online</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Adding nodes automatically re-shares token/tablet ranges; since Cassandra 4.0, eligible SSTables use zero-copy streaming (vendor claim: 5x faster scale-out); ScyllaDB&#x27;s tablets + file-level streaming make adding nodes even faster (30x is a vendor claim — see deep-dive).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__11": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL（类 SQL 但无 join/子查询/任意 WHERE）；多语言官方驱动；Spark/Hadoop 连接器；ScyllaDB 额外兼容 Amazon DynamoDB API（Alternator），DynamoDB 应用可低改迁移（官方口径）。Cassandra 5.0 新增 SAI 与向量索引，补…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL（类 SQL 但无 join/子查询/任意 WHERE）；多语言官方驱动；Spark/Hadoop 连接器；<strong>ScyllaDB 额外兼容 Amazon DynamoDB API（Alternator）</strong>，DynamoDB 应用可低改迁移（官方口径）。Cassandra 5.0 新增 SAI 与向量索引，补齐部分二级索引/相似检索场景。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). CQL (SQL-like but no joins/subqueries/arbitrary WHERE); official drivers in multiple languages; Spark/Hadoop co…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). CQL (SQL-like but no joins/subqueries/arbitrary WHERE); official drivers in multiple languages; Spark/Hadoop connectors; <strong>ScyllaDB additionally supports the Amazon DynamoDB API (Alternator)</strong>, so DynamoDB applications can migrate with minimal changes <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>. Cassandra 5.0 adds SAI and vector indexing, filling in some secondary-index / similarity-search scenarios.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__12": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra：Apache</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：Apache 2.0 纯开源；商业围绕服务与托管：DataStax（DSE 企业版、Astra DB Serverless 按读写请求量计费）2025 年 5 月被 IBM 收购并入 watsonx.data（公开报道）；另有 K8ssandra 等云原生发行版。 ScyllaDB：2025.1 起 source-av…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra：Apache</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>Apache 2.0 纯开源</strong>；商业围绕服务与托管：DataStax（DSE 企业版、Astra DB Serverless 按读写请求量计费）<strong>2025 年 5 月被 IBM 收购</strong>并入 watsonx.data（公开报道）；另有 K8ssandra 等云原生发行版。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>2025.1 起 source-available 统一版本</strong>（官方公告 2024-12）；免费额度为<strong>每组织 10TB 配置磁盘 + 50 vCPU</strong>（跨所有集群，官方 FAQ 口径），超出需商业许可；6.2 AGPL 为最后一个纯开源版本；托管为 ScyllaDB Cloud / X Cloud（按节点/资源计费模型，具体单价以官网为准，此处不引用）。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra: Apach</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Apache 2.0, pure open source; commercial activity centers on services and managed offerings: DataStax (DSE enterprise edition, Astra DB serverless billed per r…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra: Apach</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Apache 2.0, pure open source</strong>; commercial activity centers on services and managed offerings: DataStax (DSE enterprise edition, Astra DB serverless billed per read/write request) <strong>was acquired by IBM in May 2025</strong> and folded into watsonx.data (public reporting); there are also cloud-native distributions such as K8ssandra.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Source-available unified release since 2025.1</strong> (official announcement, 2024-12); the free tier is <strong>10TB of provisioned disk + 50 vCPU per organization</strong> (across all clusters, per official FAQ), with commercial licensing required beyond that; AGPL 6.2 was the last purely open-source release; managed offerings are ScyllaDB Cloud / X Cloud (per-node/resource billing model; exact pricing per the official site — not quoted here).</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__13": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra 中等</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra 中等（官方文档以英文为主；CSDN/博客中文教程多，但大量内容停留在 3.x/4.0 时代）；ScyllaDB 较少（官方英文文档为主，中文社区内容稀缺）——均为社区共识。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra 中等</span><p>Cassandra <strong>中等</strong>（官方文档以英文为主；CSDN/博客中文教程多，但大量内容停留在 3.x/4.0 时代）；ScyllaDB <strong>较少</strong>（官方英文文档为主，中文社区内容稀缺）——均为社区共识。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra is moder</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra is moderate (official docs are primarily English; many CSDN/blog Chinese tutorials exist but much of the content is stuck in the 3.x/4.0 era); ScyllaDB is spars…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Cassandra is moder</span><p>Cassandra is <strong>moderate</strong> (official docs are primarily English; many CSDN/blog Chinese tutorials exist but much of the content is stuck in the 3.x/4.0 era); ScyllaDB is <strong>sparse</strong> (official English docs dominate; Chinese community content is scarce) — both per community consensus.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__2": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：有（官方文档，4.0+）。audit_logging_options：按节点落文件的审计日志，类别含 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE，支持 keyspace/用户过滤，可运行时经 nodetool 开关；堆内存与磁盘占用有界（官方口径）。 ScyllaDB：有（官方仓库代码/社…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>有</strong>（官方文档，4.0+）。<code>audit_logging_options</code>：按节点落文件的审计日志，类别含 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE，支持 keyspace/用户过滤，可运行时经 nodetool 开关；堆内存与磁盘占用有界（官方口径）。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong>（官方仓库代码/社区论坛）。audit 子系统支持输出到 syslog 或 <code>audit.audit_log</code> 表，类别 QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ADMIN，可按 keyspace/table 选择性审计，密码脱敏；原为企业版能力，2025 年初已合并入统一代码库。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Supported (official docs, 4.0+). audit_logging_options: per-node file-based audit logs with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE, keyspace/user filt…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs, 4.0+). <code>audit_logging_options</code>: per-node file-based audit logs with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ERROR/PREPARE, keyspace/user filtering, and runtime on/off via nodetool; heap-memory and disk usage are bounded <span class=\"ev ev-vendor\" data-zh=\"厂商口径\" data-en=\"vendor claim\">厂商口径</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> (official repo code / community forums). The audit subsystem outputs to syslog or the <code>audit.audit_log</code> table, with categories QUERY/DML/DDL/DCL/AUTH/ADMIN, selective auditing by keyspace/table, and password redaction; formerly an enterprise-edition capability, merged into the unified codebase in early 2025.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__3": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：PasswordAuthenticator + CassandraAuthorizer，CQL GRANT/REVOKE 的 RBAC（keyspace/table 级），角色可嵌套；Kerberos/LDAP 为 DSE 企业版能力（开源版查证为无）。ScyllaDB：密码认证 + 角色权限（与 CQ…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。Cassandra：<code>PasswordAuthenticator</code> + <code>CassandraAuthorizer</code>，CQL <code>GRANT/REVOKE</code> 的 RBAC（keyspace/table 级），角色可嵌套；Kerberos/LDAP 为 DSE 企业版能力（开源版查证为无）。ScyllaDB：密码认证 + 角色权限（与 CQL 语义一致）+ <strong>LDAP/AD 集成</strong>（原企业版，现统一版本包含，官方发布口径）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: PasswordAuthenticator + CassandraAuthorizer, CQL GRANT/REVOKE RBAC (keyspace/table level) with nestable roles; Kerberos/LDAP are DSE…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Cassandra: <code>PasswordAuthenticator</code> + <code>CassandraAuthorizer</code>, CQL <code>GRANT/REVOKE</code> RBAC (keyspace/table level) with nestable roles; Kerberos/LDAP are DSE enterprise-edition capabilities (confirmed absent in the open-source edition). ScyllaDB: password authentication + role-based authorization (same CQL semantics) + <strong>LDAP/AD integration</strong> (formerly enterprise, now included in the unified release, per official release announcements).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__4": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。nodetool snapshot（硬链接冻结 SSTable，秒级、无 IO 冲击但占同卷磁盘）+ 增量备份 + commitlog 归档可拼出 PITR；开源 Medusa（Spotify 起源，现由社区维护）支持全量/差异备份到 S3/GCS 并可校验；恢复为逐节点拷贝 SSTable …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<code>nodetool snapshot</code>（硬链接冻结 SSTable，秒级、无 IO 冲击但占同卷磁盘）+ 增量备份 + commitlog 归档可拼出 PITR；开源 <strong>Medusa</strong>（Spotify 起源，现由社区维护）支持全量/差异备份到 S3/GCS 并可校验；恢复为逐节点拷贝 SSTable 或 <code>sstableloader</code>，TB 级大集群恢复耗时以小时计<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。<strong>ScyllaDB Manager</strong> 提供计划备份到 S3/GCS/Azure（<code>sctool</code>）；底层同样是 snapshot 机制；官方集成测试矩阵注明：恢复<strong>不支持 Authentication 与 Service Levels</strong> 的还原（官方仓库文档，选型时注意）。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Supported (official docs / community consensus). nodetool snapshot (hard-link freeze of SSTables — instant, no IO impact, but consumes same-volume disk) + incr…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). <code>nodetool snapshot</code> (hard-link freeze of SSTables — instant, no IO impact, but consumes same-volume disk) + incremental backups + commitlog archiving can together approximate PITR; the open-source <strong>Medusa</strong> (originated at Spotify, now community-maintained) supports full/differential backups to S3/GCS with verification; recovery is per-node SSTable copies or <code>sstableloader</code>, with TB-scale large-cluster recovery taking hours <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. <strong>ScyllaDB Manager</strong> provides scheduled backups to S3/GCS/Azure (<code>sctool</code>); the underlying mechanism is the same snapshot approach; the official integration-test matrix notes that recovery <strong>does not restore Authentication and Service Levels</strong> (official repo docs — note this when evaluating).</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__5": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。Cassandra：逐节点滚动升级，不停服；但大版本单向、不可降级（SSTable 格式升级后无法回退）；5.0 仅支持从 4.0/4.1 升级（官方文档口径），3.11 需先到 4.x。ScyllaDB：滚动升级；2025.1 起 Raft 驱动的一致性拓扑变更使扩缩容与升级更稳；同样不支持跨大版本降级。</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。Cassandra：逐节点滚动升级，不停服；但<strong>大版本单向、不可降级</strong>（SSTable 格式升级后无法回退）；5.0 仅支持从 4.0/4.1 升级（官方文档口径），3.11 需先到 4.x。ScyllaDB：滚动升级；2025.1 起 Raft 驱动的一致性拓扑变更使扩缩容与升级更稳；同样不支持跨大版本降级。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). Cassandra: rolling node-by-node upgrades with no downtime; but major upgrades are one-way — no downgrade (SSTab…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). Cassandra: rolling node-by-node upgrades with no downtime; but <strong>major upgrades are one-way — no downgrade</strong> (SSTable format upgrades cannot be rolled back); 5.0 only supports upgrades from 4.0/4.1 (per official docs), and 3.11 must go to 4.x first. ScyllaDB: rolling upgrades; since 2025.1, Raft-driven consistent topology changes make scale-out/in and upgrades steadier; cross-major-version downgrades are likewise unsupported.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__6": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra：部分支持<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。nodetool + JMX 指标是官方链路；Prometheus/Grafana 需外部 exporter 或第三方采集器拼装，无官方内置端到端监控栈。 ScyllaDB：有<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。内置 Prometheus metrics 端点 + 官方 ScyllaDB Monitoring…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra：<strong>部分支持</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。<code>nodetool</code> + JMX 指标是官方链路；Prometheus/Grafana 需外部 exporter 或第三方采集器拼装，无官方内置端到端监控栈。<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB：<strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。内置 <strong>Prometheus metrics 端点</strong> + 官方 <strong>ScyllaDB Monitoring</strong> Grafana 仪表盘栈（含告警），另有 REST API、tracing 与轻量慢查询日志。</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Cassandra: Partially supported (official docs / community consensus). nodetool + JMX metrics form the official path; Prometheus/Grafana require an external exporter or a …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><ul>\n<li>Cassandra: <strong>Partially supported</strong> (official docs / community consensus). <code>nodetool</code> + JMX metrics form the official path; Prometheus/Grafana require an external exporter or a third-party collector assembled yourself — there is no official built-in end-to-end monitoring stack.<ul>\n<li>ScyllaDB: <strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Built-in <strong>Prometheus metrics endpoint</strong> + the official <strong>ScyllaDB Monitoring</strong> Grafana dashboard stack (with alerting), plus a REST API, tracing, and a lightweight slow-query log.</li>\n</ul></li>\n</ul></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__7": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p class=\"snippet\">有<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL 原生二进制协议；官方多语言驱动均为 token-aware（直连负责副本的节点，避开 coordinator 跳转）；ScyllaDB 另提供 shard-aware 端口（19042） 与专用驱动，直连目标 CPU shard。连接本身轻量，无 PG 式连接数瓶颈；但 coordinator 仍是跨分区查询的汇聚…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">有</span><p><strong>有</strong><span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。CQL 原生二进制协议；官方多语言驱动均为 <strong>token-aware</strong>（直连负责副本的节点，避开 coordinator 跳转）；ScyllaDB 另提供 <strong>shard-aware 端口（19042）</strong> 与专用驱动，直连目标 CPU shard。连接本身轻量，无 PG 式连接数瓶颈；但 coordinator 仍是跨分区查询的汇聚点，超大应用机群仍建议经代理或驱动侧限流<span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Supported <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CQL native binary protocol; all official multi-language drivers are token-aware (connecting directly to the nodes owning the replicas, av…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-yes\">Supported</span><p><strong>Supported</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>. CQL native binary protocol; all official multi-language drivers are <strong>token-aware</strong> (connecting directly to the nodes owning the replicas, avoiding coordinator hops); ScyllaDB additionally offers a <strong>shard-aware port (19042)</strong> and dedicated drivers that connect directly to the target CPU shard. Connections themselves are lightweight — no PG-style connection-count bottleneck; but the coordinator remains the aggregation point for cross-partition queries, so very large application fleets should still go through a proxy or driver-side throttling <span class=\"ev ev-consensus\" data-zh=\"社区共识\" data-en=\"community consensus\">社区共识</span>.</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__8": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无多行 ACID</span><p class=\"snippet\">无多行 ACID（官方文档，查证为无）。单行写入原子；LWT（IF NOT EXISTS / IF 条件）提供单分区 Paxos compare-and-set 线性一致；BATCH 保证同分区原子性（非隔离性），跨分区 batch 仅保证最终写入、无隔离。Cassandra 4.1+ 可切 Paxos v2（paxos_variant:…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无多行 ACID</span><p><strong>无多行 ACID</strong>（官方文档，查证为无）。单行写入原子；<strong>LWT</strong>（<code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> / <code>IF 条件</code>）提供单分区 Paxos compare-and-set 线性一致；<code>BATCH</code> 保证同分区原子性（非隔离性），跨分区 batch 仅保证最终写入、无隔离。Cassandra 4.1+ 可切 <strong>Paxos v2</strong>（<code>paxos_variant: v2</code>），无竞争 LWT 从 4 RTT 降到写 2 RTT/读 1 RTT（CEP-14，社区技术文档）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No multi-row ACID</span><p class=\"snippet\">No multi-row ACID (official docs, confirmed absent). Single-row writes are atomic; LWT (IF NOT EXISTS / IF &lt;condition&gt;) provides single-partition Paxos compare-and-set li…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">No multi-row ACID</span><p><strong>No multi-row ACID</strong> (official docs, confirmed absent). Single-row writes are atomic; <strong>LWT</strong> (<code>IF NOT EXISTS</code> / <code>IF &lt;condition&gt;</code>) provides single-partition Paxos compare-and-set linearizable consistency; <code>BATCH</code> guarantees atomicity within a partition (not isolation), while cross-partition batches guarantee only eventual writes with no isolation. Cassandra 4.1+ can switch to <strong>Paxos v2</strong> (<code>paxos_variant: v2</code>), reducing contention-free LWT from 4 RTTs to 2 RTTs for writes / 1 RTT for reads (CEP-14, community technical docs).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "cassandra-scylladb__9": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无主对等复制</span><p class=\"snippet\">可调一致性<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无主对等复制；每查询指定一致性级别（ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL 等）；W+R&gt;N 保证读写集合交集；副本缺失时靠 hinted handoff（默认 3 小时窗口）+ read repair + 周期性 anti-entropy repair 收敛。ScyllaDB 语义相同…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-no\">无主对等复制</span><p><strong>可调一致性</strong><span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>。无主对等复制；每查询指定一致性级别（ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL 等）；<code>W+R&gt;N</code> 保证读写集合交集；副本缺失时靠 <strong>hinted handoff</strong>（默认 3 小时窗口）+ <strong>read repair</strong> + 周期性 <strong>anti-entropy repair</strong> 收敛。ScyllaDB 语义相同，数据分布层自 2025.1 默认 <strong>tablets</strong>（替代 vnodes，Raft 负载均衡）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Tunable consistenc</span><p class=\"snippet\">Tunable consistency <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Leaderless peer replication; per-query consistency levels (ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL, etc.); W+R&gt;N guarantees read/write set …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-neutral\">Tunable consistenc</span><p><strong>Tunable consistency</strong> <span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>. Leaderless peer replication; per-query consistency levels (ONE / QUORUM / LOCAL_QUORUM / ALL, etc.); <code>W+R&gt;N</code> guarantees read/write set intersection; when replicas are missing, convergence relies on <strong>hinted handoff</strong> (default 3-hour window) + <strong>read repair</strong> + periodic <strong>anti-entropy repair</strong>. ScyllaDB semantics are the same; its data-distribution layer defaults to <strong>tablets</strong> since 2025.1 (replacing vnodes, with Raft-based load balancing).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>", "clickhouse__0": "<div class=\"lang-block lang-zh\"><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p class=\"snippet\">部分支持——提供 encrypted 虚拟磁盘（storage policy 层），可包装本地盘、S3 等底层磁盘，按 AES-CTR 加密写入的数据文件，可按表/存储策略选择加密范围；不是&quot;一键覆盖全部数据目录&quot;的传统全库 TDE。ClickHouse Operator 文档明确：加密覆盖 MergeTree data parts，但 …</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">部分支持</span><p><strong>部分支持</strong>——提供 <code>encrypted</code> 虚拟磁盘（storage policy 层），可包装本地盘、S3 等底层磁盘，按 AES-CTR 加密写入的数据文件，可按表/存储策略选择加密范围；不是&quot;一键覆盖全部数据目录&quot;的传统全库 TDE。ClickHouse Operator 文档明确：加密覆盖 MergeTree data parts，但 server metadata 与日志不覆盖——这部分仍需 LUKS、CSI 或云盘加密兜底；密钥丢失则已加密 part 无法读取。证据：<span class=\"ev ev-official\" data-zh=\"官方文档\" data-en=\"official docs\">官方文档</span>（operator storage 指南、storing-data）。</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">展开</button></div><div class=\"lang-block lang-en\" hidden><div class=\"cell-main\"><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p class=\"snippet\">Partially supported — an encrypted virtual disk (storage-policy layer) can wrap local disks, S3 and other underlying disks, encrypting written data files with AES-CTR, se…</p><div class=\"full\" hidden><span class=\"verdict v-partial\">Partially supported</span><p><strong>Partially supported</strong> — an <code>encrypted</code> virtual disk (storage-policy layer) can wrap local disks, S3 and other underlying disks, encrypting written data files with AES-CTR, selectable per table/storage policy; not a traditional &quot;one switch encrypts the whole data directory&quot; full-database TDE. ClickHouse Operator docs are explicit: encryption covers MergeTree data parts, but server metadata and logs are not covered — those still need LUKS, CSI or cloud-disk encryption; losing the key makes encrypted parts unreadable. Evidence: official docs (operator storage guide, storing-data).</p></div></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"cell-toggle\" data-zh=\"展开\" data-en=\"Expand\">Expand</button></div>"});